    tarot: [
      ["The Fool","Step just one pace off the familiar road, and today becomes a fresh start.","Among the things you hesitate to begin today, what could you open even if it isn't perfect?"], // 0 바보
      ["The Magician","Start with what's already in your hands, and today becomes enough.","Before reaching for more today, what is already in your hands?"], // 1 마법사
      ["The High Priestess","You don't have to answer right away. Today, listening sees more clearly.","Of what you decided in a hurry today, what might change if you listened one more day?"], // 2 여사제
      ["The Empress","A nurturing heart grows not from grand resolutions, but from today's small care.","Of the things you can care for today, which is closest to you?"], // 3 여황제
      ["The Emperor","Today's place feels steady not through stubbornness, but when you make the lines you'll keep clear.","Where is the line you don't have to give up today?"], // 4 황제
      ["The Hierophant","You don't always need a new method. Use a good way you've already learned once more today.","What good method you learned before could you put to use again today?"], // 5 교황
      ["The Lovers","Today's choice isn't about who wins, but about what you keep close.","If you choose one of two today, which brings more warmth to your day?"], // 6 연인
      ["The Chariot","Direction matters more than speed. Today, just checking where you're headed is enough.","Of all you're busily doing today, what do you truly want to move toward?"], // 7 전차
      ["Strength","Today calls not for the strength to push hard, but for the strength to gently hold your place.","Rather than pressing down hard today, what can you simply keep quietly beside you?"], // 8 힘
      ["The Hermit","A little time alone is not running away. It becomes a lamp for seeing today anew.","What feeling today do you want to keep only to yourself, shown to no one?"], // 9 은둔자
      ["Wheel of Fortune","Among the things turning around you, today separates what to hold from what you can let go.","What can you let pass on its own today, without straining to stop it?"], // 10 수레바퀴
      ["Justice","Today calls not for a judgment that wins, but one that sees both sides from the same distance.","What have you looked at from only one side today?"], // 11 정의
      ["The Hanged Man","Today, stopping instead of running further makes your next step clear.","Without concluding right away, what might change today if you turned it upside down for a moment?"], // 12 매달린 사람
      ["Death","When you accept that something has ended, today something else can take its place.","What are you still holding today that has already ended?"], // 13 죽음
      ["Temperance","Today, rather than following just one side, you may blend two feelings a little at a time.","Between doing it all and quitting it all today, what could you do just a little of?"], // 14 절제
      ["The Devil","What holds you today may not be a grand enemy, but a habit too familiar to let go.","What do you keep repeating today even though you don't want to?"], // 15 악마
      ["The Tower","Where expectations fell apart, today becomes a place to rebuild rather than a place to blame.","Of the expectations that crumbled today, which was actually weak from the start?"], // 16 탑
      ["The Star","Even if things aren't clear now, there is a place to set your foot.","Of what you've paused today for lack of certainty, what needs only more information?"], // 17 별
      ["The Moon","Today, you don't have to light up everything to take a single step.","Of what you've put off today because it felt hazy, what could you start by simply naming?"], // 18 달
      ["The Sun","Today, bring just one hidden good thing into the light, and the day grows warm.","Rather than keeping it to yourself today, what could you show someone close to you?"], // 19 태양
      ["Judgement","This is not a day to put the past on trial. Today, just choose one thing to take from it.","If you bring up the past today, what could you salvage instead of blame?"], // 20 심판
      ["The World","Today may be a day not for a new start, but for looking around the road you've already traveled.","What would bring you peace today if you brought it to a close?"], // 21 세계
    ],
